        <mxCell id="c35" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;마지막 인원 퇴장&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;LeaveRoom → OnRoomClosed&lt;br&gt;방 몬스터 정리 (재입장 시 웨이브 처음부터)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
