        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;NPCDialogueUI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;텍스트 입력 / 마이크 버튼 홀드&lt;br&gt;응답 텍스트 스트리밍 표시&lt;br&gt;닫기 → NPCStopTTSEvent&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=4;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
